{"steam_appid":2939790,"steam_name":"Lunarium","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2939790/399794979/7c996ec15893aba15654b604c4cc06aa85ee1996/1785290607/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785292123","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257375552/ef4778e66f0042b3b75ac7f67a044bd20891e2b2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785292123","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/ab12b4b274799d48a4c9e8604ffe478bd1397f4c/ss_ab12b4b274799d48a4c9e8604ffe478bd1397f4c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786159430","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/68f034a8ca716a2ef41f52fcabb94b32d260c246/ss_68f034a8ca716a2ef41f52fcabb94b32d260c246.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786159430","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/24864d83227a3468ecbd21b22db4fc7f8d404f43/ss_24864d83227a3468ecbd21b22db4fc7f8d404f43.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786159430","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/8bd52227b8fbdf9e7efe6de7179937aa25bef59f/ss_8bd52227b8fbdf9e7efe6de7179937aa25bef59f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786159430","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/ac245be3616a6835769a0c9eb77a2fdba8831845/ss_ac245be3616a6835769a0c9eb77a2fdba8831845.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786159430"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On the brink of collapse in the world of Lunarium, two girls—Ave and Lune step forward.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save their dying homeland, they embark on a perilous journey into the unknown. Across multiple worlds, they must overcome countless trials while piecing together the ancient secrets of this realm—and ultimately uncover the truth hidden within themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/a324630070d99cb98e79d7c341193283.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1280 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/d796605a4dbcf6859e62f81d856f3011.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Ave</strong>, a light-armored knight, and journey alongside <strong>Lune</strong>, a flaxen-haired girl with mysterious powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they set out to save a world on the brink of collapse. Sword and magic echo between them as they fight side by side, weaving a bond that belongs to them alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/bdb189ca5c28fb5fa878c6093580eec3.poster.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/bdb189ca5c28fb5fa878c6093580eec3.webm?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/bdb189ca5c28fb5fa878c6093580eec3.mp4?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ave </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An agile knight skilled in close-quarters sword combat. With precise dodges and well-timed parries, she turns enemy attacks aside and strikes back. She is the party’s blade — and the one who stands at the front when danger closes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/c78f7230ea32018b20d8cc16e29314d0.poster.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/c78f7230ea32018b20d8cc16e29314d0.webm?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/c78f7230ea32018b20d8cc16e29314d0.mp4?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lune </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who wields mysterious magic. She can weaken enemies, enhance Ave’s attacks, and break through obstacles in the environment. She is an irreplaceable source of support — and the key to moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/fa0e3726f8e09d895c74dd6f0b78b86b.poster.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/fa0e3726f8e09d895c74dd6f0b78b86b.webm?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/fa0e3726f8e09d895c74dd6f0b78b86b.mp4?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/226e200f1771d23dff85654d099c6016.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can adjust Ave’s combat style through <strong>Embroidery</strong>, the <strong>Skill Tree</strong>, and <strong>Cloaks</strong>, building a flexible progression system for different ways to fight.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cloak System </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloaks offer both unique appearances and ability effects. Players can choose different cloaks to match their preferred way of fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/d94657965e255777202cf9ccccc0b549.poster.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/d94657965e255777202cf9ccccc0b549.webm?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/d94657965e255777202cf9ccccc0b549.mp4?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embroidery System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embroidery works like charms, each carrying a different power. Equipping them grants Ave passive enhancements that can support different combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/61d6ecf51decdf37cf774ae06a0165e3.poster.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/61d6ecf51decdf37cf774ae06a0165e3.webm?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/61d6ecf51decdf37cf774ae06a0165e3.mp4?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/4239db3634bd7688e5e7e69ca4ae908d.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into unguarded temples, the ruins of fallen kingdoms, and churches shrouded in dark mist. Each area has its own atmosphere, terrain, and combat rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forgotten lands, observe your surroundings, learn the mechanics, and press onward through a journey filled with danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/ed092c6caa10f8725de2af488fc68ca3.poster.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/ed092c6caa10f8725de2af488fc68ca3.webm?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/ed092c6caa10f8725de2af488fc68ca3.mp4?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/be9168d6a165e864370327cab8faa5b3.poster.avif?t=1786159430\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/be9168d6a165e864370327cab8faa5b3.webm?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/be9168d6a165e864370327cab8faa5b3.mp4?t=1786159430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Our journey begins with parting, and perhaps it will also face parting in the end. The hardships along the way will surpass your understanding and imagination... You might even feel pain because of this.&quot;</i> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Even so, will you still come with me?&quot;</i></strong></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 2.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050Ti / R9 285<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080 Ti / RX Vega 64<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["月相仪Lunarium"],"publishers":["月相仪Lunarium","Imperfect Games"],"release_date":"Jul 28, 2026"}